H7905.strongs:
Origin: feminine of 7900 in the sense of 7899;
Meaning: a dart (as pointed like a thorn)
KJV renders: barbed iron.

H7906.strongs:
Origin: from an unused root apparently meaning to surmount; an observatory (with the article);
Meaning: Seku, a place in Palestine
KJV renders: Sechu.

H7907.strongs:
Origin: from the same as 7906;
Meaning: observant, i.e. (concretely) the mind
KJV renders: heart.

H7908.strongs:
Origin: infinitive of 7921;
Meaning: bereavement
