H7910.strongs:
Origin: or שִׁכֹּר; from 7937;
Meaning: intoxicated, as a state or a habit
KJV renders: drunk(-ard, -en, -en man).

H7911.strongs:
Origin: or שָׁכֵחַ; a primitive root;
