KJV renders: × at all, (cause to) forget.

H7912.strongs:
Origin: (Aramaic) corresponding to 7911 through the idea of disclosure of a covered or forgotten thing;
Meaning: to discover (literally or figuratively)
KJV renders: find.

H7913.strongs:
Origin: from 7911;
Meaning: oblivious
KJV renders: forget.

H7914.strongs:
Origin: feminine from the same as 7906;
Meaning: a conspicuous object
KJV renders: picture.

H7915.strongs:
Origin: intensive perhaps from the same as 7906 in the sense of 7753;
Meaning: a knife (as pointed or edged)
KJV renders: knife.

H7916.strongs:
Origin: from 7936;
Meaning: a man at wages by the day or year
KJV renders: hired (man, servant), hireling.

H7917.strongs:
Origin: feminine of 7916;
Meaning: a hiring
KJV renders: that is hired.

H7918.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
Meaning: to weave (i.e. lay) a trap; figuratively, (through the idea of secreting) to allay (passions; physically, abate a flood)
KJV renders: appease, assuage, make to cease, pacify, set.

H7919.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
Meaning: to be (causatively, make or act) circumspect and hence, intelligent
KJV renders: consider, expert, instruct, prosper, (deal) prudent(-ly), (give) skill(-ful), have good success, teach, (have, make to) understand(-ing), wisdom, (be, behave self, consider, make) wise(-ly), guide wittingly.

H7921.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
Meaning: properly, to miscarry, i.e. suffer abortion; by analogy, to bereave (literally or figuratively)
KJV renders: bereave (of children), barren, cast calf (fruit, young), be (make) childless, deprive, destroy, × expect, lose children, miscarry, rob of children, spoil.

H7922.strongs:
Origin: or שֵׂכֶל; from 7919;
Meaning: intelligence; by implication, success
KJV renders: discretion, knowledge, policy, prudence, sense, understanding, wisdom, wise.

H7923.strongs:
Origin: plural from 7921;
Meaning: childlessness (by continued bereavements)
KJV renders: to have after loss of others.

H7924.strongs:
Origin: (Aramaic) from 7920;
Meaning: intelligence
KJV renders: understanding.

H7925.strongs:
