Meaning: to be tranquil, i.e. secure or successful
KJV renders: be happy, prosper, be in safety.

H7952.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root (probably identical with 7953 through the idea of educing);
Meaning: to mislead
KJV renders: deceive, be negligent.

H7953.strongs:
